{"hits": {"hits": [{"links": {"bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/68505?format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/68505?format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/68505?format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/68505?format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/68505?format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/68505?format=cv", "citations": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A68505"}, "updated": "2023-03-06T14:51:39.352116+00:00", "id": "68505", "created": "2001-05-22T00:00:00+00:00", "metadata": {"publication_info": [{"journal_volume": "33", "page_end": "238", "year": 1971, "page_start": "221", "journal_title": "Nucl.Phys.B"}, {"journal_volume": "36", "artid": "642", "material": "erratum", "year": 1972, "page_start": "642", "journal_title": "Nucl.Phys.B"}], "authors": [{"full_name": "Landshoff, P.V."}, {"full_name": "Polkinghorne, J.C."}], "texkeys": ["Landshoff:1971zu"], "imprints": [{"date": "1971"}], "abstracts": [{"value": "Two processes are discussed: (a) semi-inclusive electroproduction experiments; (b) heavy-lepton pair production in hadronic collisions. The non-perturbative approach to the parton model is used to evaluate scaling properties and to consider extra contributions due to wee partons. These latter have not been previously discussed and are found to be important for process (b), but absent in process (a). Quantitative agreement is obtained for process (b), including an explanation of the observed shoulder in the differential cross section."}], "control_number": 68505, "dois": [{"value": "10.1016/0550-3213(72)90244-1"}, {"value": "10.1016/0550-3213(71)90398-1"}], "titles": [{"title": "Two high energy processes involving detected final state particles"}, {"title": "HIGH-ENERGY"}], "author_count": 2, "document_type": ["article"]}}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/l